      "t": "note",
      "text": "কাল (kal) means both 'yesterday' and 'tomorrow'. The tense of the verb tells you which: কাল গিয়েছিলাম (past) is 'yesterday I went'; কাল যাব (future) is 'tomorrow I will go'. To be clear you can say গতকাল (yesterday) or আগামীকাল (tomorrow)."
