      "t": "p",
      "text": "The first bibhakti (প্রথমা, nominative) marks the doer (কর্তা). It usually has no ending at all. The doer just stands in front of the verb. You can add -রা to a group of people, -ই for emphasis, or -টা / -টি for 'the'."
