      "text": "The plural endings and the case endings can be combined. The plural -রা marks the doer. The ending -দের covers both the object and 'of' for people: ছেলেদের means 'the boys' (object) and 'of the boys' (genitive). For things, add -গুলো first and then the case ending: বইগুলোর (of the books), বইগুলোতে (in the books)."
